<script>
    $(document).ready(function(){
      $(document).on("click",".grid-product__content button[name='add-to-cart']",function() {
        let variant_id = parseInt($(this).attr("variant-id"));
         $.ajax({
          url: "/cart/add.json",
          method: 'POST',
          data: {
            quantity : 1,
            id: variant_id
          },
          success: function(cart){
            document.dispatchEvent(new CustomEvent('cart:build'));
            $.ajax({
                url: "/cart.json",
                method: 'GET',
                success: function(cart){
                  onlyFreeProductInCart ();
                  var cartPrice = cart.total_price / 100;
                  var percentage = cartPrice *100 / 2000;
                  var minus_price = 2000 - cartPrice ;
                  var width;
                  if(cartPrice < 2000){
                    width = percentage+"%";
                    $("#CartDrawerForm .minus-price").text("You are away Rs."+minus_price+" form free shipping!");
                    $("#CartDrawerForm .progress-bar .drawer-blue").removeClass("active");
                  }else{
                     width = '100%';
                    $("#CartDrawerForm .minus-price").text("Congratulations you have free shipping");
                    $("#CartDrawerForm .progress-bar .drawer-blue").addClass("active");
                  };
                  $("#CartDrawerForm .progress-bar .drawer-blue").css({width :width});
                  document.dispatchEvent(new CustomEvent('cart:open'))
                  let cucEvent = new Event('customEventCardCart');
                  document.dispatchEvent(cucEvent);
                }
              });
          }
        });
      })
    });
  function onlyFreeProductInCart () {
    fetch('/cart.js')
      .then(response => response.json())
      .then(cart => {
          const itemsToRemove = cart.items.filter(item => item.id === 42087125221585);
          if (itemsToRemove.length > 1) {
              let removePromises = [];
              itemsToRemove.slice(1).forEach(item => {
                  removePromises.push(
                      fetch('/cart/change.js', {
                          method: 'POST',
                          headers: {
                              'Content-Type': 'application/json',
                              'Accept': 'application/json'
                          },
                          body: JSON.stringify({
                              id: item.key,
                              quantity: 0
                          })
                      })
                  );
              });
              Promise.all(removePromises).then(() => {
                document.dispatchEvent(new CustomEvent('cart:build'));
              });
          }
      })
  }
</script>

                
                <div id="AjaxinatePagination">
                  
                    <a href="/collections/watches-for-men?page=2">Load More</a>
                  
                </div>
              </div>
            </div><hr class="hr--clear hr--medium" ><div class="collection-description rte" >
              <div class="enlarge-text r-more">
                <div class="read-more-less">
                  <div id="truncated"><p dir="ltr"><span>There is something quietly powerful about the moment a man clasps a well-made watch onto his wrist. It clicks. It settles. It feels like it belongs there.</span></p> <p dir="ltr"><span>Watches for men have never really been about telling time alone...</div>
                  <a href="javascript:;" class="read-more btn">Read More</a>
                </div>
                <div class="read-more-less" style="display:none;">
                  <div id="truncated"><p dir="ltr"><span>There is something quietly powerful about the moment a man clasps a well-made watch onto his wrist. It clicks. It settles. It feels like it belongs there.</span></p>
<p dir="ltr"><span>Watches for men have never really been about telling time alone - they have always been about telling the world something about who you are, what you value and where you are headed.</span></p>
<p dir="ltr"><span>At Sylvi, we believe a watch should work as hard as the man wearing it. Built in India, for Indian lives - the heat of a Delhi summer, the pace of a Mumbai Monday morning, the quiet pride of a first big promotion - our collection of </span><span>men's watches</span><span> is designed to move with you, not against you.</span></p>
<p dir="ltr"><span>Whether you reach for a sharp</span><a title="analog watch" href="https://sylvi.in/collections/analog-watches"><span> </span><strong>analog watch</strong></a><span> or a refined automatic, every Sylvi timepiece is priced between Rs. 1,000 and Rs. 5,000 so that real craftsmanship stays within real reach.</span></p>
<h2><strong>Why Sylvi Watches Work for the Indian Man</strong></h2>
<p dir="ltr"><span>India is not one climate, one culture or one pace of life. It is thirty different seasons happening at once. A watch that works only in an air-conditioned boardroom will fail you on a sun-drenched wedding lawn in Jaipur or a monsoon-drenched commute in Bengaluru. Why should a man have to choose between style and survival?</span></p>
<p dir="ltr"><span>Sylvi watches for men are designed keeping exactly this in mind. The cases are built to handle humidity. The dials are legible under harsh afternoon light. The straps - leather, mesh, silicone - are chosen for how they feel after eight hours on the wrist, not just how they look in a photograph. And Sylvi passes that test quietly, every single day.</span></p>
<p dir="ltr"><span>The young professional today - the man between 22 and 35 - is sharp. He reads the room. He knows that a </span><span>branded watch for men</span><span> does not need to cost a fortune to look like one. He wants value, he wants craft and he wants something that does not scream for attention. Sylvi was built for exactly that man.</span></p>
<h3 dir="ltr"><strong>The Craft Behind Every Sylvi Watch</strong></h3>
<p dir="ltr"><span>Hold a Sylvi watch in your palm and you understand immediately that something different is happening here. The weight feels intentional - not too heavy, not too light. The dial looks crisp under any light source. The bezel sits flush, the crown turns smoothly and the caseback is finished with the kind of care that only matters to those who know where to look.</span></p>
<p dir="ltr"><span>Our men's analog watch range uses precision quartz movements that maintain accuracy within seconds per month. The</span><a title="automatic watch for men" href="https://sylvi.in/collections/automatic-watches-for-men"><span> </span><strong>automatic watch for men</strong></a><span> range goes a step further - powered entirely by the natural movement of your wrist, with no battery ever needed. Sapphire-coated mineral glass protects the dial against daily knocks. Stainless steel cases resist moisture and sweat. Each component is reviewed against a strict internal quality standard before a single watch leaves our facility.</span></p>
<p dir="ltr"><span>Every strap, every lug, every printed numeral on the dial is a decision. Design at Sylvi is never accidental. It is the result of many revisions, many prototypes and many honest conversations about what a</span><a title="men's wrist watch analog" href="https://sylvi.in/collections/analog-watches-for-men"><span> </span><strong>men's wrist watch analog</strong></a><span> really should feel like in 2025.</span></p>
<h3 dir="ltr"><strong>Explore the Sylvi Men's Watch Collection</strong></h3>
<p dir="ltr"><span>The Classic Dial Series. Minimal. Confident. Unmistakable. The Classic Dial is for the man who does not need decoration to make a statement. A clean white or black dial, slim steel case and a</span><a href="https://sylvi.in/collections/watch-straps/products/10mm-black-silver-leather-strap"><span> </span></a><a rel="noopener" title="leather strap" href="https://sylvi.in/collections/leather-strap-watches" target="_blank"><strong>leather strap</strong></a><span> that softens beautifully over time - this is the men's watch analog that suits a formal meeting at 10 AM as naturally as it suits a quiet dinner by 8 PM. </span></p>
<p dir="ltr"><span>Think of the Bengaluru startup founder who wears the same watch to pitch day and to his parents' anniversary dinner. That is exactly who this was made for.</span></p>
<p dir="ltr"><span>The</span><a href="https://sylvi.in/collections/mesh-strap"><span> </span></a><a rel="noopener" title="Mesh Strap Collection" href="https://sylvi.in/collections/mesh-strap-watches" target="_blank"><strong>Mesh Strap Collection</strong></a><span>. There is a particular kind of man who finds leather too formal and rubber too casual. The mesh strap hits that precise middle ground. These wrist watch brands men actually wear daily - to the gym in the morning, to a client call in the afternoon and to a rooftop gathering at night. </span></p>
<p dir="ltr"><span>The interwoven steel sits cool against the wrist, breathes well in humid months and looks just as good in July as it does in January.</span></p>
<p dir="ltr"><span>The Automatic Movement Range.</span><a href="https://sylvi.in/collections/automatic-watches-for-men"><span> </span></a><a rel="noopener" title="Automatic watches for men" href="https://sylvi.in/collections/automatic-watches-for-men" target="_blank"><strong>Automatic watches for men</strong></a><span> carry a certain romance that no quartz movement can quite replicate. You can actually see the movement through the caseback on select models. You feel the rotor turning. </span></p>
<p dir="ltr"><span>The watch is alive in a way that sounds strange until you experience it yourself. No battery, no external power source - just physics and precision working together every second of every day. </span></p>
<p dir="ltr"><span>Priced from Rs. 3,500, this is affordable mechanical watchmaking done with genuine respect for the craft.</span></p>
<p dir="ltr"><span>The Pilot Inspired Dials. Bold numerals. High contrast. A dial that is readable at 120 kmph on a highway or across a dimly lit conference room. The pilot-inspired range draws from aviation aesthetics without being costume-like. </span></p>
<p dir="ltr"><span>It is a watch brand man kind of watch - something with a point of view, worn by someone who has one too.</span></p>
<h3 dir="ltr"><strong>What the Colour on Your Wrist Says About You</strong></h3>
<p dir="ltr"><span>Colour in men's watchmaking is rarely accidental. A black dial communicates authority and focus. A white or cream dial suggests calm precision - the man who thinks before he speaks. </span></p>
<p dir="ltr"><span>A navy blue sunburst dial is worn by someone who understands elegance but does not take it too seriously. A champagne gold detail on a steel case bridges heritage and contemporary taste in one quiet gesture.</span></p>
<p dir="ltr"><span>Sylvi mens watches are available across a palette that serves every mood and every wardrobe. Darker dials pair beautifully with formal Indian wear - a charcoal bandhgala or a crisp white kurta. </span></p>
<p dir="ltr"><span>Lighter tones work alongside western casuals, linen shirts and relaxed chinos. Choose the colour that feels like you - not the one you think you should wear.</span></p>
<h3 dir="ltr"><strong>How to Choose the Right Watch for Men</strong></h3>
<p dir="ltr"><span>Start with occasion. If you spend most of your week in meetings, presentations or client-facing roles, a slim analogue watch with a leather strap makes the clearest statement. </span></p>
<p dir="ltr"><span>If your days are more varied - some desk hours, some outdoor movement, some social time - a stainless mesh or silicone strap gives you flexibility without sacrificing style.</span></p>
<p dir="ltr"><span>Next, consider movement type.</span><a href="https://sylvi.in/collections/analog-watches-for-men/products/opus-black-silver-silicone"><span> </span></a><strong>Mens analog watch</strong><span> options with quartz movements are ideal for those who want zero maintenance and consistent accuracy. </span></p>
<p dir="ltr"><span>Men's automatic wrist watch options suit those who appreciate mechanical heritage and enjoy the ritual of wearing a watch that winds itself through natural motion. Neither is superior - it is simply a question of what you connect with.</span></p>
<p dir="ltr"><span>Finally, set a realistic budget. Within the Rs. 1,000 to Rs. 5,000 range, Sylvi offers genuine variety. Entry-level analog options deliver clean design and reliable accuracy. Mid-range pieces add finishing details - brushed steel, exhibition casebacks, multi-layer dials. </span></p>
<p dir="ltr"><span>The top of our range introduces automatic movements and premium leather straps that develop character over years of wear.</span></p>
<h3 dir="ltr"><strong>Why Sylvi - Made in India, Built for Every Man</strong></h3>
<p dir="ltr"><span>Sylvi is proudly Made in India. That is not a marketing line - it is a commitment. Our</span><a href="https://sylvi.in/"><span> </span></a><a title="watches" href="https://sylvi.in/"><span><strong>watches</strong></span></a><span> are conceived, designed and assembled in India, which means we understand the Indian buyer better than any imported brand ever could. </span></p>
<p dir="ltr"><span>We know what value luxury means to a young professional saving up for his first real timepiece. We know what a gift for a father looks like when it needs to feel expensive but cost sensibly.</span></p>
<p dir="ltr"><span>The Certified Imperfect Programme is one of our most honest offerings. Minor cosmetic variations - a small dial asymmetry, a slight case finish difference that does not affect function in any way - are offered at reduced prices with full transparency. Because we believe in value, not illusion.</span></p>
<p dir="ltr"><span>The Sylvi Prototype Programme gives watch enthusiasts early access to pre-production models at special prices. You get a genuinely rare piece. We get honest feedback. Both sides win. </span></p>
<p dir="ltr"><span>Our after-sales support is handled directly - no third-party runaround, no waiting weeks for a response. Har din ke liye ek shaandaar ghadi. That is the Sylvi promise.</span></p>
<h3 dir="ltr"><strong>Style Ideas and the Best Gift for Men Who Have Everything</strong></h3>
<p dir="ltr"><span>A Sylvi watch makes one of the most thoughtful gifts you can give - and one of the easiest to get right. For Diwali, pair a gold-accented dial with a <a rel="noopener" title="premium gift box" href="https://sylvi.in/collections/timecrate-watch-box" target="_blank"><strong>premium gift box</strong></a> and you have something that feels genuinely indulgent without the imported price tag. </span></p>
<p dir="ltr"><span>For a wedding shagan, a classic leather strap watch inside a wooden presentation box is the kind of gesture people remember.</span></p>
<p dir="ltr"><span>Corporate gifting deserves a special mention. Branded watches for men are among the highest-recall gifts a company can send - far ahead of pens, diaries or dry fruit boxes. A Sylvi watch on a client's or employee's wrist is a daily reminder of your brand's attention to quality. Bulk orders are available with customised packaging.</span></p>
<h3 dir="ltr"><strong>Caring for Your Sylvi Watch - Maintenance and Longevity</strong></h3>
<p dir="ltr"><span>A watch that looks after you deserves to be looked after in return. For leather strap models, avoid prolonged exposure to water and direct sunlight. Wipe the case gently with a soft microfibre cloth after wearing - it removes oils and dust that dull the finish over time. The strap feels softer and more supple with regular use, developing a patina that tells your story quietly.</span></p>
<p dir="ltr"><span>Automatic watches benefit from occasional servicing every three to five years, depending on usage. Store them in a watch box or pouch when not worn to prevent dust from settling on the crystal. </span></p>
<p dir="ltr"><span>Quartz models simply need a battery change every one to two years - most local jewellers handle this in under ten minutes. Sylvi's customer support team is available for any guidance you need after purchase.</span></p>
<h3 dir="ltr"><strong>Everyday Reliability - The Watch That Does Not Let You Down</strong></h3>
<p dir="ltr"><span>A <strong>luxury wrist watch for men</strong> should not be saved for Sundays. The best watches earn their place by being worn every day, through ordinary moments that quietly become extraordinary ones. </span></p>
<p dir="ltr"><span>The morning chai run. The train platform where a quick glance at the time saves the day. The interview room where the first impression is made before a word is spoken.</span></p>
<p dir="ltr"><span>Sylvi watches are tested for daily wear. Water resistance, shock resistance and strap durability are verified across production batches - not just on a sample or two. Reliable. Consistent. Present. That is what a watch for men should be. Not a showpiece. A companion.</span></p>
<h3 dir="ltr"><strong>Conclusion</strong></h3>
<p dir="ltr"><span>Watches for men have always carried weight beyond their grams. They mark arrivals and departures. They anchor routines. They make quiet promises. At Sylvi, we make sure every watch we put into the world is worthy of that responsibility - crafted with precision, priced with fairness and designed to last far longer than a trend.</span></p>
<p dir="ltr"><span>Whether you are shopping for yourself or searching for the</span><a href="https://sylvi.in/collections/watches-for-gift"><span> </span></a><a title="best gift for men" href="https://sylvi.in/collections/watches-for-gift"><strong>best gift for men</strong></a><span> in your life, Sylvi's men's collection has a timepiece that earns its place. Explore the full range at sylvi.in and find the watch that feels like it was made for you. Because it was.</span></p>
<p dir="ltr"><span>That's the thing about time - it stays honest when craftsmanship does.</span></p>
<p dir="ltr"><span>Updated for 2025.</span></p>
