<style> #shopify-section-template--17462436528337__main-collection .grid {margin: 0;} #shopify-section-template--17462436528337__main-collection #CollectionAjaxContent .grid {gap: 30px;} </style></div><div id="shopify-section-template--17462436528337__b2734cee-94a9-449f-99b9-ecd830f0b856" class="shopify-section">
  <center><h2>Frequently Asked Questions</h2></center>
<div class="faq_main_div">
  <div class='faq_d-display'>
    <div class='faq_d-details'><details class='faq_tab-control' open>
        <summary>What is the price range of Sylvi watches for men?</summary>
        <p>Sylvi mens watches are priced between Rs. 1,000 and Rs. 5,000, covering everything from clean everyday analog watches to refined automatic movement timepieces. Every price point is built with the same attention to quality and finishing that defines the Sylvi brand.</p>
      </details><details class='faq_tab-control'>
        <summary>Are Sylvi watches good for daily wear?</summary>
        <p>Yes. Sylvi watches for men are tested for water resistance, shock resistance and strap durability. They are designed for Indian daily life - whether you are commuting, working or attending events. The build quality is validated across production batches, not just on individual samples.</p>
      </details><details class='faq_tab-control'>
        <summary>Which Sylvi watch is best for a young professional?</summary>
        <p>The Classic Dial Series and the Mesh Strap Collection are both excellent choices for young professionals. The classic analog watch suits formal and semi-formal settings. The mesh strap is versatile enough for gym mornings and client meetings alike. Both ranges fall comfortably within the Rs. 1,000 to Rs. 3,500 segment.</p>
      </details><details class='faq_tab-control'>
        <summary>What is the difference between an analog and automatic watch?</summary>
        <p>An analog watch uses a battery-powered quartz movement to drive the hands - accurate, low-maintenance and reliable. An automatic watch is powered entirely by wrist movement, with no battery required. Both types are available in the Sylvi men's collection, catering to different preferences and budgets.</p>
      </details><details class='faq_tab-control'>
        <summary>Is a silicone watch strap a good choice for travel and long hours?</summary>
        <p>Absolutely. Silicone handles heat, sweat, and movement comfortably. It stays flexible all day during commutes, gym time, and weekend trips. A practical pick for active lifestyles.</p>
      </details></div>
    <div class='faq_d-imgs'>
      <div class='faq_imgs'></div>
    </div>
  </div>
</div>






